<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Brent Erensel initiated coverage of Banco Frances del Rio del la Plata SA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Erensel described Banco Frances as Argentina's highest quality banking company, and noted it is building its franchise with a 50-branch expansion program.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 7/8 to 27-1/8 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
